      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(codex): classify commandExecution mutability via shared isMutatingToolCall",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #101890 — strict-agentic retry cannot retry terminal turns that only\nperformed read-only shell commands because `isMutatingNativeToolItem` always\ntreats `commandExecution` items as mutating.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`isReplaySafeToolCall` returns `false` for all `exec`/`bash` calls even though\na read-only shell classifier already exists. `isMutatingNativeToolItem` then\ntreats all `commandExecution` items as mutating.\n\n## Fix\n\nUse `isReplaySafeToolCall(\"exec\", itemToolArgs(item))` in\n`isMutatingNativeToolItem` instead of unconditionally returning `true`.\nImported from the existing internal module (no new SDK API surface).\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Runtime Proof: `isReplaySafeToolCall` production function\n\nBefore (main `4bf70be01a`):\n\n```\nisReplaySafeToolCall(\"exec\", args) — main (before fix)\n============================================================\n  ❌ rg TODO                  → replaySafe: false\n  ❌ ls -la                   → replaySafe: false\n  ❌ cat                      → replaySafe: false\n```\n\nAfter (PR head `5b35ae64`):\n\n```\nisReplaySafeToolCall(\"exec\", args) — PR #102106 head\n============================================================\n  ✅ rg TODO                  → replaySafe: true\n  ✅ ls -la                   → replaySafe: true\n  ✅ cat                      → replaySafe: true\n  ❌ echo > file (write)      → replaySafe: false\n  ❌ rm -rf                   → replaySafe: false\n  ❌ npm install              → replaySafe: false\n```\n\nRead-only commands are now classified as replay-safe; mutating commands remain\nfail-closed.\n\nFull chain: `isMutatingNativeToolItem → isSideEffectingNativeToolItem →\nrecordToolMeta → sideEffectingToolItemIds → hadPotentialSideEffects →\nreplayMetadata`.\n\nCommand run:\n```\nnode --import tsx -e 'import { isReplaySafeToolCall } from \"./src/agents/tool-mutation.js\"; ...'\n```\n\n### Autoreview (claude-sonnet-5)\n\n→ patch is correct (0.98), no accepted/actionable findings\n\n### Test Results\n\n- `extensions/codex/src/app-server/outcome-fallback-runtime-contract.test.ts` — 7/7 passed\n- `src/agents/tool-mutation.test.ts` — read-only shell classification tests passed\n\n- [x] oxfmt + oxlint pass\n- [x] No new SDK API surface\n- [x] autoreview clean (0.98)\n",
        "branch": "fix/101890-strict-agentic-retry-readonly",
